    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      501.67,
      286.68,
      577.28
    ],
    "text": "Land Ministry\u2019s No. : 4-3/9/2019/S/223. I hereby give notice, under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land / servitude which is required for a public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      588.56,
      286.69,
      672.56
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land in extent of 0.0405 hectare depicted as the Lot No. 1 in sheet 1 Block 1 of the Cadastral Map No. 620568 of the preliminary plan dated 20.10.2023, prepared by the surveyor General, situated in the Village called Endana in Atakalan Korale Pannil Pattu Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Kahawatta in Ratnapura District of the Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      426.56,
      539.65,
      489.68
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 01 Name of the land: Endanawatta; Description: Garden, a permanent building a mixed crop cultivation with a teak tree of about 15-20 years old are available; Claimant : Kahawatta Plantations PLC, Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.0405 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      489.89,
      539.62,
      597.43
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Kahawatta Divisional Secretariat, on 25th March, 2024 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 25th March 2024 the nature of their interests in the land/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
