      57.6,
      152.01,
      291.48,
      247.75
    ],
    "text": "Reference No.: Kela/7/IA/3/232. I do hereby notify under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act amended by Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to obtain the following land for a public purpose: Details of the land to be obtained,",
    "fonts": [
