  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      309.6,
      138.53,
      548.44,
      188.24
    ],
    "text": "All that have rights or other relationships for the said land/servitude should meet me individually or the persons authorized by means of their documents at 9.30 a.m. on 15th March 2024 at Kelaniya Divisional Secretariat.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      309.6,
      188.72,
      545.91,
      272.96
    ],
    "text": "Further, please inform me in writing the nature of the right to the said land/lands a description on the grounds for requesting compensation to obtain servitude of that land, the amount of compensation and the way that the said amount calculated before 06th March 2024. Deeds and other supportive documents that confirm rights should be presented on the date of investigation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
